"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-31T14:26:49Z","updated_at":"2025-12-31T14:26:49Z","body":"Bisected to #103416\nCC @CreatedBySeb ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3702299052/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3708395156","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114443#issuecomment-3708395156","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114443","id":3708395156,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dCZ6U","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-04T20:20:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-04T20:20:16Z","body":"Thanks for the report, I've found the issue. When we select an AnimationPlayer in the Scene Tree panel it also calls `make_visible(true)` on the `AnimationPlayerEditorPlugin` which, among other things, calls `set_process(true)` on the `AnimationPlayerEditor`.\n\nCalling either `plugin->make_visible(true)` or `set_process(true)` is enough to fix this bug, however I'm inclined to use `plugin->make_visible(true)` to ensure the same setup as if we had selected a node manually. Since we only hit this point in `_find_player` if the editor is visible, I don't think this should pose any issues, and performing the same calls as `EditorNode::_plugin_over_edit` should avoid any similar inconsistencies elsewhere/in the future.\n\nHave opened a PR with this change: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114603","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3708395156/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]